{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p id=\"p-rc_e1244cf244083299-421\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>無綫劇集《死有對証》現正熱播中，劇中飾演女法醫「程醫生」的港姐冠軍陳曉華（Hera），憑着精湛演出與知性美貌深受觀眾喜愛。近日，陳曉華突發於社交平台大放福利，上載了一組甜度爆表的花絮照，展現出與劇中嚴肅法醫形象截然不同的「初戀感」！</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_e1244cf244083299-422\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>相中可見，陳曉華戴上一頂黑框圓眼鏡，造型極具學生氣息。不論是身穿綠邊白 T 裇、肩上披着黃色針織衫坐在桌前伏案甜笑，抑或是於夜間乘車時回眸凝視鏡頭，甚至是靠在車路指示牌前俏皮眨眼比 V 字手勢，全套造型均散發出濃濃的清純「初戀感」，青春活力十足。</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c79effd7-1868-4447-a87d-38b397e2615a.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026Wqmt5NFbLa1789721405.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c79effd7-1868-4447-a87d-38b397e2615a.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e67cd2de-3e0d-4d68-b86a-33b0fbef54e2.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026tQYeuaSqLY1789721404.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e67cd2de-3e0d-4d68-b86a-33b0fbef54e2.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_e1244cf244083299-423\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>陳曉華在貼文中感性留言寫道：「程醫生遇到初戀嘅時候。」更讓人驚喜的是，相中多張充滿「男友視角」的美照，原來全是出自劇中飾演其初戀男友的許俊豪（Lincoln）之手！許俊豪隨後亦在貼文下搞笑留言稱：「好彩我影得都幾好😆😂」，展現出兩人在戲裏戲外的默契與好感情。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_e1244cf244083299-423\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_e1244cf244083299-424\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>不少網民紛紛大讚陳曉華的眼鏡造型令人驚艷，熱烈留言表示：「程醫生呢個眼鏡 Look 太可愛！」、「初戀感滿滿」、「許俊豪好識影！」</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_e1244cf244083299-424\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"fa08cd4f-f284-4a13-ba09-2416821d67cc.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026mfdB9GEoB81789721404.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"fa08cd4f-f284-4a13-ba09-2416821d67cc.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-18T09:13:52.802478+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":436,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}